  "description": "Stories are power. Artifacts born from myths and folktales bestowed abilities and wealth upon humanity, sparking a battle for them. I eventually triumphed in this battle and became the King of Artifacts, Majesty... but... \n\n\"Majesty No. 187,487 Registration Complete.\" \n\n\"The Forced Reset of Humanity Begins.\" \n\n\"The Majesty War is Permitted.\" \n\nSo that was just the beginning? So what? There are those bastards who stole what was mine. \n\n\"You want to do it by the law? Fine, by my law.\" \n\nAnyone can win by force. They overturn myths, steal the rules, and plunder worlds. \n\n\"Thanks very much for inviting me to the treasure vault! You bastards!\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/event/c1ff7e29b48cdfea6c63e8664e6f20c2)",
